        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents Large Decorative Apollo Door Pull Plate 3-5/8\" Wide x 25-1/2\" High</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large decorative door pull plate from the Brass Accents Renaissance Collection. Highly detailed solid cast brass styled in Italian Renaissance, popular around the turn of last century.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <b>Matching <a href=\"/products/apollo-push-plate-solid-brass-brass-accents-a04-p5240\">Large Decorative Apollo Push Plate</a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  Brass Accents A04-P5241 Decorative Apollo Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 25-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Finish Warranty: 10 Years</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. Hand rubbed and finished in the USA with a 10 year warranty.\r\n</p>",
